(notes "Buffet: All You Can Sheet. The back office is open and the front office is not: so far the market's calendar, a market day a second; its dice, rolled once a day where anyone can watch them roll; the market itself, four waves and a drift, moving once a day; four stocks priced off it in whole cents, the dearest paying a dividend four days a year; the fine print, a disclosure a month; and the Series 777's question bank, twenty questions awaiting an exam the regulator has yet to schedule. Pick the Day, the Dice, the Market or the Stocks sheet to watch, or the Disclosures or the Questions sheet among the hidden sheets.")
